  "exercise_count": 2,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据近距作用理论，带电体相互作用的总能量是集中在这些物体的电场中. 就是说，能量可以用电场的主要性质——电场强度来表示.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 197,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0206#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们把平行板电容器电容的数值(8-38)代到公式(8-43)中的最后一个式子，并用电场强度代替公式(8-43)中的电势差: $|V|=Ed$. 于是，电容器的能量等于",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 197,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0206#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$E_P=\\frac{CV^2}{2}=\\frac{\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon S}{d}\\cdot\\frac{E^2d^2}{2}=\\frac{\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon E^2}{2}Sd.$　(8-44)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 197,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0206#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(8-44)式被电场所占有的体积$Sd$除，则得到单位体积的能量，即能量密度:",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 198,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0207#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\omega=\\frac{\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon E^2}{2}.$　(8-45)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 198,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0207#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在静电单位制中，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 198,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0207#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\omega=\\frac{\\varepsilon E^2}{8\\pi}.$　(8-46)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 198,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0207#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "得到的表示式(8-45)和(8-46)，不仅对于平行板电容器的匀强电场是正确的，对于任何静电场，都是正确的. 而且，所得到的能量密度的表示式，对于交变电场也是正确的.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 198,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0207#5"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
